# Vendored third-party documentation, regenerated by runner/make_context.py.
#
# ratatui and superlighttui ship their own READMEs, examples and docs under
# their own licences. `make_context.py` copies them here so a C1 run gets
# exactly what a user of that crate gets, but they are not this project's
# code and committing them would vendor someone else's licensed material into
# an AGPL repository without attribution.
#
# Hawk TUI's and DeweyGUI's own context is committed: the first is this
# repository's own README and generated ontology, and the second is a single
# README from a sibling project under the same ownership.
ratatui/
superlighttui/
